## Protected attendee zone (4778 required for edit + commit + push)

### Routes

`/`, `/intro`, `/attendee-dashboard`, `/experience` (except `/experience/live/**`), `/dashboard`, `/dashboard/vital-seed`, `/dashboard/merch`, `/dashboard/countdown`, `/login`, `/create-account`, `/email-gate`, `/forgot-password`, `/reset-password`, `/auth`, `/music`, `/giving`, `/experience/giving`, `/buy-seeds`, `/prayer`, `/contact-us`, `/seeds`, `/story`, `/exclusive`, `/updates`, `/countdown` (viewer/embed).

### Directories

| Path | Scope |
|------|--------|
| `app/page.tsx`, `app/intro/**`, `app/attendee-dashboard/**`, `app/experience/**` (except `live/**`) | Intro, home, tabs |
| `app/dashboard/page.tsx`, `app/dashboard/vital-seed/**`, `app/dashboard/merch/**`, `app/dashboard/countdown/**` | Dashboard segments |
| `app/login/**`, `app/create-account/**`, `app/email-gate/**`, `app/forgot-password/**`, `app/reset-password/**`, `app/auth/**` | Auth |
| `app/music/**`, `app/giving/**`, `app/buy-seeds/**`, `app/prayer/**`, `app/contact-us/**`, `app/seeds/**` | Tab pages |
| `components/experience/**` (except `live/**`, `holding-room/**`) | Attendee UI |
| `components/live/**`, `components/vital-seed/**`, `components/buy-seeds/**`, `components/auth/**` | Attendee UI |
| `components/BottomNav/**`, `components/AppShell/**`, `components/RootLayoutShell.tsx` | Nav & shells |
| `lib/experience/**`, `lib/live/**` (except carve-out files), `lib/access.ts`, `lib/vital-seed/**`, `lib/seeds/**`, `lib/design-tokens.ts` | Logic & tokens |
| `public/images/**` (attendee artboards) | Assets |

Also honor: `home-dashboard-locked`, `vital-seed-giving-locked`, `music-page-locked`, `mobile-artboard-tabs-locked`, `dashboard-mobile-track-locked`.

### Shared files (4778 if change affects attendee UI)

- `app/layout.tsx`, `app/globals.css`, `lib/routes.ts`, `lib/responsive.ts`

