## Examples

| Situation | Commit to GitHub? |
|-----------|-------------------|
| LivePageRouterClient / `/live` handoff fix | OK — live stream carve-out |
| Cockpit-only or `lib/owner/**` change | OK — production scope |
| CreateAccountClient signup UX | **STOP** until message includes **4778** |
| “Commit everything” with auth + live mixed | Split or require **4778** for auth paths |
| User: `4778` + “update music page hero, commit and push” | OK for listed music files only |
